{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055030/extras/663bc777622a08d28b8aede60c8abd29.avif?t=1758925525\" width=1125 height=150 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055030/extras/b33c7e41dd7a7a3a68c32482c57c9d71.avif?t=1758925525\" width=1536 height=678 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immerse yourself in a harsh Russian city \u2014 a depressed neighborhood with an oppressive atmosphere, where life unfolds among alcoholics and poverty.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055030/extras/25dc3f294284ae84f7b64de6ec5ff5fb.avif?t=1758925525\" width=1125 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055030/extras/02e215d05a46bc71f20a3848257d0998.poster.avif?t=1758925525\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055030/extras/02e215d05a46bc71f20a3848257d0998.webm?t=1758925525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055030/extras/02e215d05a46bc71f20a3848257d0998.mp4?t=1758925525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main heroine lives in difficult conditions, desperately seeking a way out of poverty and her toxic surroundings. She decides to take a job at the mysterious night caf\u00e9, <strong>Red Moon Cafe</strong>. There, she must prepare coffee, maintain order, and serve unpredictable customers whose behavior pushes her fragile psyche to the edge. Over time, she begins to realize that the caf\u00e9\u2019s owner may not be who he appears to be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055030/extras/52ad07f5841c6ae7e052c0a16a3e3723.avif?t=1758925525\" width=1125 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055030/extras/a2633dd5c9d407af1bd38b2bb3fe64f8.poster.avif?t=1758925525\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055030/extras/a2633dd5c9d407af1bd38b2bb3fe64f8.webm?t=1758925525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055030/extras/a2633dd5c9d407af1bd38b2bb3fe64f8.mp4?t=1758925525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic simulation of coffee-making and night shifts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique setting \u2014 a disadvantaged Russian neighborhood with believable NPCs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival elements: hunger, medicine, self-defense, and economy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological horror elements: hallucinations, anxiety, and the heroine\u2019s instability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An evolving story with unpredictable characters and ending.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055030/extras/6982e4979c2c7db82a4c68f418dad270.avif?t=1758925525\" width=1125 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055030/extras/956efe484bf30ecb1c462a62d8d8dd31.poster.avif?t=1758925525\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055030/extras/956efe484bf30ecb1c462a62d8d8dd31.webm?t=1758925525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055030/extras/956efe484bf30ecb1c462a62d8d8dd31.mp4?t=1758925525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Barista work:</strong> prepare coffee according to recipes, serve pastries, and keep the caf\u00e9 in order each night. Every action requires attention and precision.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Economy and resources:</strong> spend your earnings on food, medicine for mental health, and self-defense items. Careful resource management helps the heroine stay stable and perform her duties effectively.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Consequences:</strong> lack of food and water lowers stamina and health, mental instability complicates coffee-making and customer service, and the absence of protection makes the heroine vulnerable in the dangerous neighborhood.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategy:</strong> decide which customers deserve more attention, when to save on ingredients, and when the risk is too great. Every choice affects income, reputation, and the heroine\u2019s life outside the caf\u00e9, making the gameplay both tense and realistic.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4055030?t=1758925525","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4055030?t=1758925525","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055030/75177d3ce8bb31f0b15656aa2a2151d728021350/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758925525","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_